* You bring a colleague into your wiki on purpose: add their role under **"Who may write this wiki"** (or manage) in the wiki dialog.

* Every teacher has a **private role of their own**. Other teachers can neither see nor open your wikis.
* Cooperation is always a deliberate grant to chosen people — not to all teachers.
* New colleagues need an account first ([[Inviting someone]]).